# Ordering API checks (VS Code REST Client or JetBrains HTTP Client).
# Start the service first, see README "Ordering service".
@base = http://localhost:8001/api/v1
@demoCart = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@emptyCart = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Seeded demo cart: 200
GET {{base}}/carts/{{demoCart}}

### Add item to cart (command): 200
POST {{base}}/carts/{{demoCart}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "jeans-blue-32", "quantity": 1}

### More than 5 units of one SKU: 422 QuantityLimitExceeded
POST {{base}}/carts/{{demoCart}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "DRESS-RED-M", "quantity": 2}

### Item removed from cart: 200
DELETE {{base}}/carts/{{demoCart}}/items/JEANS-BLUE-32

### Place order (create): 201
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"cart_id": "{{demoCart}}"}

### Place order for the empty seeded cart: 422 EmptyCart
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"cart_id": "{{emptyCart}}"}

### List orders: 200
GET {{base}}/orders
